UNVERIFIED / REMAINING
No physical-device checks: ghosting cleanup effectiveness, battery LIPC behavior,
real statvfs values, e-ink latency and power-button/suspend integration need testing.
The actual Charles Fort EPUB was unavailable; the larger synthetic fixture was used.
IMPORTANT: first-use cold EPUBs with an existing late saved position/anchor or
legacy annotation migration can still require synchronous full pagination before
first display. The next open uses the accelerator. This case is not fully solved.
A single unusually huge HTML chapter can still delay open or cancellation until
that chapter layout finishes. The photo detector is a heuristic, not OCR.
No claim that every 10-20-second device opening stall has been eliminated.
